    "landing_founder_zTBkD3": {
      "type": "Landing-founder",
      "name": "Founder Story",
      "settings": {
        "subtitle": "Our Story",
        "title": "Born from Loss,\nDesigned for Forever",
        "story_html": "<p>I grew up in Lagos, Nigeria — a place bursting with colour, sound, and story. But my own story had a gap. I lost my father when I was just three years old. No letters. No recordings. Just a handful of faded photographs I would hold up to the light, trying to memorise the shape of a man I could barely remember.</p><p>That ache — the longing for something tangible to hold onto — never left me. It became the seed of The Visual Book. I wanted to create something that didn't just store memories, but honoured them. Something you could touch, open, and feel the weight of a moment that might otherwise slip away.</p><p>Every Visual Book is crafted with that same urgency: the belief that the people and moments we love deserve more than a cloud folder. They deserve permanence. They deserve beauty. They deserve to be held.</p>",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "Read Full Story",
        "founder_name": "Adanna Okafor",
        "founder_title": "Founder & CEO"
      }
    },
